    "anchor": "01.04",
    "summary": "Distances can be checked freely and default to the closest point on a model’s base. A range limit includes its boundary. Any qualifying part can put a model within range. Wholly within requires its entire base, or the entire model for FRAME. A unit qualifies for the ordinary test with one model and for the wholly-within test only if every model qualifies. The rule user’s controller breaks ties for nearest.",
